
--> Centralized Logging
    What is Centralized Logging?
        Collect logs from multiple services
        Store in one place
        Search, filter, analyze

    Challenges in Microservices
        Logs spread across servers
        Hard to trace requests
        No single visibility

    ELK Stack (Intro)
        Elasticsearch → Storage & search
        Logstash → Log processing
        Kibana → Visualization

--> Spring Boot Actuator

    What is Actuator?
        Provides production-ready endpoints
        Used for monitoring & management

    Common Actuator Endpoints
    | Endpoint | Purpose             |
    | -------- | ------------------- |
    | /health  | App health          |
    | /metrics | Performance metrics |
    | /info    | App information     |
    | /env     | Environment         |

